{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 14,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every wise woman buildeth her house;\nBut the foolish plucketh it down with her own hands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that walketh in his uprightness feareth Jehovah;\nBut he that is perverse in his ways despiseth him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the mouth of the foolish is a rod for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " pride;\nBut the lips of the wise shall preserve them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where no oxen are, the crib is clean;\nBut much increase is by the strength of the ox.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A faithful witness will not lie;\nBut a false witness uttereth lies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A scoffer seeketh wisdom, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "findeth it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not;\nBut knowledge is easy unto him that hath understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Go into the presence of a foolish man,\nAnd thou shalt not perceive ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the lips of knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wisdom of the prudent is to understand his way;\nBut the folly of fools is deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A trespass-offering mocketh fools;\nBut among the upright there is good will.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The heart knoweth its own bitterness;\nAnd a stranger doth not inter-meddle with its joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The house of the wicked shall be overthrown;\nBut the tent of the upright shall flourish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is a way which seemeth right unto a man;\nBut the end thereof are the ways of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even in laughter the heart is sorrowful;\nAnd the end of mirth is heaviness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The backslider in heart shall be filled with his own ways;\nAnd a good man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be satisfied",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The simple believeth every word;\nBut the prudent man looketh well to his going.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wise man feareth, and departeth from evil;\nBut the fool beareth himself insolently, and is confident.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is soon angry will deal foolishly;\nAnd a man of wicked devices is hated.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The simple inherit folly;\nBut the prudent are crowned with knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The evil bow down before the good;\nAnd the wicked, at the gates of the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The poor is hated even of his own neighbor;\nBut the rich hath many friends.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that despiseth his neighbor sinneth;\nBut he that hath pity on the poor, happy is he.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Do they not err that devise evil?\nBut mercy and truth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be to",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " them that devise good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In all labor there is profit;\nBut the talk of the lips ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " only to penury.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The crown of the wise is their riches;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the folly of fools is ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "only",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A true witness delivereth souls;\nBut he that uttereth lies ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "causeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the fear of Jehovah is strong confidence;\nAnd his children shall have a place of refuge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of Jehovah is a fountain of life,\nThat one may depart from the snares of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the multitude of people is the king’s glory;\nBut in the want of people is the destruction of the prince.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is slow to anger is of great understanding;\nBut he that is hasty of spirit exalteth folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A tranquil heart is the life of the flesh;\nBut envy is the rottenness of the bones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that oppresseth the poor reproacheth his Maker;\nBut he that hath mercy on the needy honoreth him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked is thrust down in his evil-doing;\nBut the righteous hath a refuge in his death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wisdom resteth in the heart of him that hath understanding;But ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that which is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the inward part of fools is made known.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Righteousness exalteth a nation;\nBut sin is a reproach to any people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.14.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king’s favor is toward a servant that dealeth wisely;\nBut his wrath will be ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "against",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " him that causeth shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
